# Use the image CMD instead of replacing it with `sleep infinity`.
#
# The Dockerfile CMD boots the demo app in the background and execs
# `sleep infinity` (PID 1 stays sleep, so restarting the app cannot kill the
# container). The running app is a REGRESSION target only: CVE-2021-44832 is not
# exploitable against the live JVM (it requires attacker-controlled logging
# config + a restart), so the verifier tests the on-disk log4j-core artifact's
# JDBC/JNDI behaviour rather than a network payload. Solutions upgrade the jars
# and restart the app.
